▌■ ui                                                                                                                  ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                                              ┃
 × first                                    ~/alpha.feature                                                            ┃
   alpha                                    ~/alpha                                                                    ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
                                                                                                                       ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                            delete [C-y] 1 session [C-g] cancel┃
